<title>PERU: Peru's money base expands 13.6 percent in July.</title>
<headline>Peru's money base expands 13.6 percent in July.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's money base expanded 13.6 percent during July to stand at 4.320 billion soles at the end of the month, the Central Reserve Bank said Monday.</p>
<p>The money base was 3.996 billion soles at the end of the 1996, up from 3.658 billion soles at the beginning of the year.</p>
<p>((-- Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
</text>
